{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.28, "text": "why wouldn't you buy a duplex a year,"}, {"start": 2.56, "end": 4.78, "text": "live in one unit, rent out the other unit,"}, {"start": 5.08, "end": 6.58, "text": "then after you've been there for six months,"}, {"start": 6.68, "end": 7.92, "text": "start shopping for your next one,"}, {"start": 8.72, "end": 10.66, "text": "do it again on a conventional loan."}, {"start": 10.72, "end": 12.16, "text": "So you can do an FHA loan for the first one,"}, {"start": 12.22, "end": 13.8, "text": "do a conventional loan for the second one"}, {"start": 13.8, "end": 14.74, "text": "and then do it again."}, {"start": 15.4, "end": 17.2, "text": "And let's just say you did that three times."}, {"start": 17.34, "end": 19.1, "text": "You get six to 12 units."}, {"start": 19.1, "end": 23.52, "text": "Six to 12 units that you got in with a 5% down payment,"}, {"start": 24.04, "end": 25.64, "text": "rents are gonna increase over time,"}, {"start": 25.76, "end": 27.64, "text": "your property value is gonna go up over time."}, {"start": 28.21, "end": 30.54, "text": "And if you never bought another property in 30 years,"}, {"start": 30.58, "end": 32.3, "text": "those things are paid off and they supplement your."}], "words": [{"w": "why", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.2}, {"w": "wouldn't", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.52}, {"w": "you", "start": 0.52, "end": 0.8}, {"w": "buy", "start": 0.8, "end": 1.1}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.32}, {"w": "duplex", "start": 1.32, "end": 1.82}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.82, "end": 2.0}, {"w": "year,", "start": 2.0, "end": 2.28}, {"w": "live", "start": 2.56, "end": 2.78}, {"w": "in", "start": 2.78, "end": 2.96}, {"w": "one", "start": 2.96, "end": 3.16}, {"w": "unit,", "start": 3.16, "end": 3.5}, {"w": "rent", "start": 3.66, "end": 3.84}, {"w": "out", "start": 3.84, "end": 4.06}, {"w": "the", "start": 4.06, "end": 4.2}, {"w": "other", "start": 4.2, "end": 4.4}, {"w": "unit,", "start": 4.4, "end": 4.78}, {"w": "then", "